      "statement": "code-change.ts is the single owner of the code-change invariants (wire types, application, composition, transformation, diffing, ingestion validation, priority convention); a chat's uncommitted state is a sequence of CodeChanges each expressed relative to a revision, carrying no base content, which is what lets them compose with git-backed storage.",
