      "statement": "Client changes are validated in two ordered stages: validateCodeChangeSchema before any transform (structural well-formedness) and validateCodeChangeContent after transforming to the server's current revision (lengths/boundaries against actual content); neither re-checks the declared shape because capnweb-validate's generated validator establishes it at the RPC edge.",
