    {
      "id": "claim_22b2297963534f7ba2bd03f6cbcab3c2",
      "statement": "The chat code-base model tracks pins (immutable ChatGadgetPin baseCommit fixed at first modification, with mutable mergedCommit tracking how far mainline has been merged), a change-stream generation bumped content-preservingly by merges or destructively by reverts/discards/agent aborts, an epoch-opening message sequence, and the current revision; accepting changes requires mergedCommit to equal the gadget's current head or the chat is stale.",
