      "id": "claim_a9d0e3386bb6478abe7d4447f187d5d1",
      "statement": "Line splitting is lossless by construction: only \\n ends a line, so \\r or U+2028/U+2029 stay inside lines rather than being treated as boundaries that would silently corrupt content using them.",
